  "hotfix_zip_note": "The self-reference exception applies only to the pack-internal manifest.json shipped inside the ZIP (which cannot record its own bytes' hash). This file is external to the ZIP, so its hash is recorded directly above (provenance.hotfix_candidate_zip) and again in PACK_A_HOTFIX1_CHECKSUMS.sha256.",
  "packaging_self_review_note": "An earlier packaging pass shipped a locally-mutated model/LLscalar_v3_UFO_runtime/py3_model.pkl (rewritten by an intermediate `pack-a run` invoked directly in the staging tree during development, before checksums.sha256 exclusion was added) instead of the pristine release-candidate bytes. Caught by re-diffing the staged tree against the release candidate for binary/`Only in` markers before finalizing; the pristine pkl was restored from a never-executed clean extraction and the ZIP/diff/hashes below were regenerated without re-invoking pack-a in the staging tree. All hashes and regression evidence in this manifest and PACK_A_HOTFIX1_VALIDATION.md reflect the corrected, final artifact."
